> Well if eating diary stuff is a result of lack of vit. D due to lack of
> sunlight up im der fjords, how does one explain that dairy farming starts
> in the middle east, with cows, goats, even horses?  Seems to me more like
> a nasty environment with little to eat, resulting in people eating
